<urn:silmaril:user:interface:portal:element:45> a portal:Paragraph ;
    geometry:hasGeometry <urn:silmaril:user:interface:portal:geometry:45> ;
    interface:text "The eight-rung algebra fold now has a design, a monoid worked example, and gate records. Read them in full in the reading room, then use the atlas to follow the actual Turtle declarations. Proof status describes the evidence claimed by a record; it is not a live build result." .

